@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/use-case-diagram
hide footbox

actor User
participant System
participant "Google Maps API" as Maps

 User -> System: 1. Opens map View
 System -> Maps: 1.1 Requests map interface
 Maps --> System: 1.2 Returns map
 System --> User: displays map with markers

 opt User selects a markers
    User -> System: 2. Clicks EcoPoint marker
    System -> System: 2.1 Pre-fills EcoPoint data
    System --> User: redirects to UC4 (Register Recycling)
end
@enduml